## Diagram 9: Feasible Window Computation Flowchart

```
+=====================================================================================+
|                                                                                     |
|                    FEASIBLE COALITION WINDOW                                       |
|                    COMPUTATION ALGORITHM                                           |
|                                                                                     |
+=====================================================================================+
|                                                                                     |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|  |                          START                                           |     |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|            |                                                                        |
|            v                                                                        |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|  |  STEP 1: ESTIMATE PARAMETERS                                             |     |
|  |                                                                           |     |
|  |  Input:                                                                   |     |
|  |  - Technical capacity vector c = [c_1, ..., c_n]                         |     |
|  |  - Coordination cost matrix Gamma = [gamma_ij]                           |     |
|  |  - Verification effectiveness lambda_eff                                 |     |
|  |  - Enforcement credibility psi_i                                         |     |
|  |  - Diplomatic friction eta_0                                             |     |
|  |  - Baseline latency tau_0                                                |     |
|  |  - Complexity exponent alpha                                             |     |
|  |  - CCW outcome omega                                                     |     |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|            |                                                                        |
|            v                                                                        |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|  |  STEP 2: COMPUTE DETERRENCE THRESHOLD                                    |     |
|  |                                                                           |     |
|  |  For each state i:                                                        |     |
|  |    Theta_D^i = -(1/lambda_eff) * ln(1 - (1-delta_i)gamma_i /            |     |
|  |                 (delta_i psi_i [D_i + C_i + C_coord^i]))                 |     |
|  |                                                                           |     |
|  |  Theta_D = max_i Theta_D^i                                               |     |
|  |                                                                           |     |
|  |  Find m_min:                                                              |     |
|  |    Sort capacities descending: c_(1) >= c_(2) >= ... >= c_(n)            |     |
|  |    m_min = min{m : sum_{j=1}^m c_(j) >= Theta_D}                        |     |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|            |                                                                        |
|            v                                                                        |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|  |  STEP 3: SOLVE LMI FOR CRITICAL DELAY                                    |     |
|  |                                                                           |     |
|  |  Grid over tau in [tau_0, tau_0 + delta]:                                |     |
|  |    Solve LMI:                                                            |     |
|  |      [ -PA-A^TP+Q-tau A^TRA    PW-tau A^TRW     P    -tau A^TR ]        |     |
|  |      [  W^TP-tau W^TRA       -Q-tau W^TRW      0    -tau W^TR ]        |     |
|  |      [     P                      0          -gamma^2 I   0      ]        |     |
|  |      [  -tau RA               -tau RW           0    -tau R    ]        |     |
|  |      < 0                                                                |     |
|  |                                                                           |     |
|  |    If feasible: increase tau                                            |     |
|  |    If infeasible: tau_crit = last feasible tau                           |     |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|            |                                                                        |
|            v                                                                        |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|  |  STEP 4: COMPUTE CRITICAL COALITION SIZE                                 |     |
|  |                                                                           |     |
|  |  eta_eff = eta_0 - beta * PreDelegation + zeta * gamma_bar_S             |     |
|  |                                                                           |     |
|  |  m_crit = floor(1 + (n-1) * ((tau_crit - tau_0) / eta_eff)^(1/alpha))   |     |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|            |                                                                        |
|            v                                                                        |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|  |  STEP 5: CHECK NON-EMPTINESS                                             |     |
|  |                                                                           |     |
|  |  Condition:                                                               |     |
|  |    eta_eff <= (tau_crit - tau_0) / ((m_min - 1)/(n - 1))^alpha          |     |
|  |                                                                           |     |
|  |  +-----------------------------------+                                   |     |
|  |  |  Is m_min <= m_crit?             |                                   |     |
|  |  +-----------------------------------+                                   |     |
|  |       |                    |                                               |     |
|  |       | YES                | NO                                            |     |
|  |       v                    v                                               |     |
|  |  +-----------+     +-------------------+                                   |     |
|  |  |  WINDOW   |     |  WINDOW EMPTY     |                                   |     |
|  |  |  NON-EMPTY|     |                   |                                   |     |
|  |  |           |     |  Identify binding |                                   |     |
|  |  |  W =      |     |  constraint:      |                                   |     |
|  |  |  [m_min,  |     |  - Verification   |                                   |     |
|  |  |   m_crit] |     |  - Friction       |                                   |     |
|  |  |           |     |  - Ratification   |                                   |     |
|  |  +-----------+     +-------------------+                                   |     |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|            |                                                                        |
|            v                                                                        |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|  |                          END                                             |     |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------------+     |
|                                                                                     |
+=====================================================================================+
```

